  "causal_interpretation": [
    "Bonsai's target is not the throughput bottleneck by itself: its serial target decode is substantially faster than Qwen's.",
    "Qwen turns its slower target into much higher end-to-end throughput because speculative decoding is far more efficient: it commits far more generated tokens per target forward and needs roughly half as many target forwards for the same generated-token count.",
